   "source": [
    "G is simple if no loops and no 2 edge join same pair of Vertices of G."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fdebb9be-5cfe-4202-bf9c-4d885ae22a9f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Show that if $G$ is simple, then $\\epsilon \\leq \\binom{v}{2}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0d1d28f2-4ad5-4c69-9845-13415d2c06c9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Non planar graph can be simple"
   ]
